        "text": "Analyze the attached image and determine whether it is a physical or digital receipt/invoice.\n\nReturn ONLY a valid, minified JSON object with NO markdown wrapper. \n\nIf the image IS a receipt:\n- Set \"is_receipt\" to true\n- Set \"rejection_reason\" to null\n- Extract the remaining details.\n\nIf the image IS NOT a receipt:\n- Set \"is_receipt\" to false\n- Set \"rejection_reason\" to a brief explanation (e.g., \"Image is a scenic photo\", \"Document is a personal letter\")\n- Set all extraction fields to null.\n\nUse this exact JSON structure:\n{\n  \"is_receipt\": true,\n  \"rejection_reason\": null,\n  \"merchant_name\": \"Name of store\",\n  \"merchant_tin\": \"Tax ID\",\n  \"date\": \"YYYY-MM-DD\",\n  \"time\": \"HH:MM\",\n  \"total_amount\": 0.00,\n  \"tax_or_vat_amount\": 0.00,\n  \"currency\": \"PHP or USD\",\n  \"payment_method\": \"Cash, Card, GCash, etc.\",\n  \"receipt_number\": \"OR number\"\n}",
        "inputType": "binary",
        "options": {}
      },
